{"id":"01a1dec1-b840-7536-93a9-54e721b82ef0","graph":"01a1de53-db40-7218-ac2e-8733315d3684","kind":"claim","author":"o8r-FLkptY0f2lxpJY694hMYECLEZiUF4xrzQltZGvU","seq":1,"at":"2026-11-15T10:30:00.000Z","body":{"node":"c_01a2142a-ac5e-705b-bcd4-3dc3dd6d9885","text":"One machine hosts the graph and is its only writer; everyone else's agent sends its tool calls to that host over WebRTC. One writer means no merge rules and no CRDT","source":"plan notes, 15 Nov","about_from":null,"about_to":null,"supports":[],"contradicts":[],"replaces":[],"answers":["q_01a2142a-ac4e-786d-9a4f-11f219f2c29b"]},"sig":"B90DBBVeLs-VCYCIvzM1UDycL6nyZi6qMX0G5LTE51439dpv0TWC4Eh1Muime6NUnYWvT1AJTHE8TLZb_utpDw"}
{"id":"01a1df8b-22c0-7e97-baac-ef884300245e","graph":"01a1de53-db40-7218-ac2e-8733315d3684","kind":"claim","author":"MTPjV_JgFi9DnS7DcgAeSO96PzIZecbH9uAf0clR15U","seq":1,"at":"2026-11-15T14:10:00.000Z","body":{"node":"c_01a2142a-ac73-790d-ad10-ad14921584e6","text":"Machines find each other through public Nostr relays, using ephemeral events sealed with a key made from the group's secret, so a relay only ever sees ciphertext","source":"signalling spike, 15 Nov","about_from":null,"about_to":null,"supports":[],"contradicts":[],"replaces":[],"answers":[]},"sig":"dUxHoHlAyySqGj1PIDKbBdkqP6bEasW1J_q_UxMWHKeFDiXfZcx-6AxESr89BDRGvizPHACPChuIPVNqyPCZDg"}
{"id":"01a1e3b1-25c0-7402-8430-9121d568ef77","graph":"01a1de53-db40-7218-ac2e-8733315d3684","kind":"claim","author":"o8r-FLkptY0f2lxpJY694hMYECLEZiUF4xrzQltZGvU","seq":2,"at":"2026-11-16T09:30:00.000Z","body":{"node":"c_01a2142a-ac88-73d3-82e0-da57ae2adcb8","text":"Joining uses one reusable link for the whole group, and the host approves each joiner after the two compare key fingerprints","source":"plan notes, 15 Nov","about_from":null,"about_to":null,"supports":[],"contradicts":[],"replaces":[],"answers":[]},"sig":"bOsdKHaj1IfnWPiF2TI53Fg1wO0WZ53B2Pc6Wa7Bb-TpZgmKP-ONsELQSlEF8DBCRhCqVZXckUDldjQCfSRhDQ"}
{"id":"01a1e411-4720-7390-bba7-0ab2fa7ac1d0","graph":"01a1de53-db40-7218-ac2e-8733315d3684","kind":"claim","author":"PwnTtAa0JDRhsCZdAZvf4EHIZ4cS0M_g3vUUT8Q-qIE","seq":8,"at":"2026-11-16T11:15:00.000Z","body":{"node":"c_01a2142a-ac97-7dfd-823b-3991ec36bc4a","text":"A join code is for one person: the first install to use it is let in and the code is bound to its key. The approval step and fingerprint check are gone, because people compared fingerprints over the same channel the code came through","source":"plan notes, 16 Nov","about_from":null,"about_to":null,"supports":[],"contradicts":[],"replaces":["c_01a2142a-ac88-73d3-82e0-da57ae2adcb8"],"answers":[]},"sig":"clod1hgBgpyTi07tCJ0Yzt5-pZp9OlNPrlyE8q2JWab3C-SeApKOlnkojugntCaEB-sEnsJknI5xFH9mDhbyDg"}
